[["heading","SECTION 30 / 34 • VISUAL TEACHING EDITION"],["heading","Mobile, Shopify,\nSEO and AI"],["text","Full-stack software engineering interview preparation"],["sinhala","","Mobile apps, e-commerce storefronts, search visibility සහ AI integration එකින් එක Jතේරුම්",485],["sinhala","","ගනිමු. Diagram එක බලලා concept එක Jතේරුම් ගන්න. ඊළඟට code එක කියවලා interview",483],["sinhala","","answer එක තමන්Jගේ වචනවලින් කියන්න.",220],["heading","18"],["heading","Original topics\n24"],["heading","Additional lessons\n42"],["text","Total lessons"],["heading","Mobile app\nShopify store\nSEO visibility\nAI assistant"],["heading","Build • publish • discover • assist"],["heading","Study method"],["text","Read the English definition and Sinhala explanation; trace the diagram, run or adapt the example,\nrehearse the interview answer, then complete the exercise."],["heading","CV connection"],["text","Movie Explorer (React Native, Expo, NativeWind, Appwrite), KCS Overseas (Shopify and SEO),\nPreethi.ai website SEO and Medi Track chatbot. These are CV-reported projects. Examples in this\nguide are teaching scenarios, not claims about how those projects were implemented."],["text","Scope: original checklist + previous study guide + 19 new interview lessons. Examples use\nillustrative snippets and pseudocode; platform/SDK setup is required. No live stores, search\naccounts, or AI APIs are accessed."]]